      <p>Structure hazard information with <code>&lt;hazardstatement&gt;</code>. Its <code>&lt;messagepanel&gt;</code> separates the hazard, consequence, and avoidance instructions. An optional <code>&lt;hazardsymbol&gt;</code> supplies an image.</p>
